.TH KINTSUGI-VALIDATE 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-validate \- provider validation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi validate
[\-\-provider <name>] [\-\-model <id>] [\-\-timeout <duration>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a live validation battery for a provider/model.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-provider\fR
Provider name
.IP \fB\-\-model\fR
Model id
.IP \fB\-\-timeout\fR
Validation timeout
.SH EXAMPLES
Validate default provider:
.PP
  $ kintsugi validate
.PP
Validate specific provider:
.PP
  $ kintsugi validate --provider ollama
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-doctor (1)
